              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Add a mobileFullScreen variant to components/ui/responsive-modal.tsx: inset-0, h-full, rounded-none, own safe-top, no drag handle. It already portals to <body>, backdrops, traps focus, restores focus and handles Escape. Not ui/sheet.tsx — its mobile branch is aria-modal=\"false\" with no backdrop and no focus trap, which is wrong for a full takeover.",
