              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A 44×44 chevron-left button (aria-label \"Back to document\") pinned left in the overlay's own 56px header. Escape and swipe-down also dismiss. On close, focus returns to the trigger — KbChatTrigger already implements this for both `open` and `embeddedConciergeOpen`.",
