              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The existing gold KbChatTrigger pill in the content header — \"Ask about this document\" / \"Continue thread\" with the thread dot. Raise it to min-h-[44px] on mobile. No second floating FAB: one trigger drives both the markdown sidebar and the C4 embedded Concierge today, and that stays true.",
