              "fill": "#B4B4B4",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "z-50, portaled to <body>, spanning inset-0 — the mobile top bar (min-h-14 safe-top, md:hidden) is underneath it. Two reasons: the nav drawer is also z-50, so leaving the hamburger tappable lets the drawer stack over an open chat (exactly the layering leak #7222 is about); and a visible top bar implies the document is still reachable when it is not. The overlay owns safe-top itself, so the notch is still respected.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
